---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - John Doe" currentPath="/about">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About Me</h1>
    
    <p>Hello! I'm John Doe, a software engineer based in San Francisco. I love building things that are useful and elegant.</p>
    
    <h2>Background</h2>
    <p>I studied Computer Science at Stanford University, where I developed a passion for web development and machine learning. Since graduating, I've been working at various tech companies, building products that help people.</p>
    
    <h2>What I Do</h2>
    <p>Currently, I work as a software engineer at a tech company, focusing on building scalable web applications and exploring the intersection of technology and human experience.</p>
    
    <h2>When I'm Not Coding</h2>
    <p>You can find me:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Exploring hiking trails in the Bay Area</li>
      <li>Reading about philosophy and psychology</li>
      <li>Experimenting with new recipes in the kitchen</li>
      <li>Contributing to open source projects</li>
      <li>Meditating and practicing mindfulness</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Feel free to reach out! <a href="/contact">Send me a message</a> or find me on social media.</p>
    
    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
